<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Surgical cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Surgical cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities downgraded U.S. Surgical Corp to hold from buy, a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- U.S. Surgical said Friday that a jury found in favor of Applied Medical in a patent suit.  But U.S. Surgical said the judge has not affirmed the jury verdict.</p>
<p>-- Trading in U.S. Surgical's stock was halted on the New York Stock Exchange for news pending.</p>
</text>
